    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Null Hypothesis (H₀)&lt;/strong&gt;: The default assumption (no effect, no difference)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alternative Hypothesis (H₁)&lt;/strong&gt;: What we&amp;rsquo;re trying to prove&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
